From 7937ce7325eb17f9b99fb869c030ea8d2c8e42fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bradent27-sketch <304192343+bradent27-sketch@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 08:41:39 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Retire v2_scheme_alignment_blend,
 v2_coaching_aware_defense_prior and v2_defense_prior_games_override

- v2_scheme_alignment_blend (2026-08-27): evidence-weighted blend of the alignment and scheme matchups. The cross-season sweep
  (2024+2025 weeks 2-18) found scheme alone is a clean win for TE (shipped as v2_scheme_matchup, TE only) and no startable win for WR
  at any blend weight (START-WR +0.039 / +0.149 at 0.70); the "START-WR receiving_yards -0.297" lead was one season, -0.073
  [-0.345, +0.203] across two.
- v2_coaching_aware_defense_prior: per-team DEFENSE_PRIOR_GAMES by coaching-change cohort (HC+DC reset -> 8, coordinator-only -> 18).
  The weeks 2-9 gain (START-QB -0.016, START-TE -0.039) was 2 significant cells of 63, flipped sign on weeks 10-17 (START-WR +0.020*) and
  vanished fit-on-odd/score-on-even. Archived earlier as docs/archive/coaching_defense_prior_RETIRED.md.
- v2_defense_prior_games_override: a sweep hook for DEFENSE_PRIOR_GAMES, a no-op unless set.
data/coaching_changes.py stays (cohort labels and the per-team prior-games function, used by the analysis scripts); blend_defense_prior
still accepts a per-team Series. Removes the branches, SCHEME_ALIGNMENT_BLEND_FIXED_WEIGHT, DEFENSE_PRIOR_GAMES_OVERRIDE and seven
flag-specific sweep / verdict scripts. Restore with git revert of this commit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
